.TH COMMAND * 2014-04-08 "SequoiaDB" "Sequoiadb Method's Manual"
.ad l.ll 72.ce 1000
\fBdb.traceStatus()\fR
.ce 0
.sp 2

.SH "NAME"

.sp 2
traceStatus

.SH "SYNOPSIS"

.sp 2

.sp 2

.sp 2
db.traceStatus()
.SH "CATEGORY"

.sp 2

.sp 2
Sdb
.SH "DESCRIPTION"

.sp 2
Show the current status of the program trace.

.SH "PARAMETERS"
.sp 2
None

.SH "RETURN VALUE"
.sp 2
On success, return void.
.sp 2
On error, exception will be thrown.
.sp 2
.SH "ERRORS"
.sp 2
when exception happen, use getLastError() to get the error code and use
getLastErrMsg() to get error message.
For more detial, please reference to Troubleshooting.

.SH "Examples"

.sp 2
Show the current status of the program trace.
.sp 2
> db.traceStatus()
